    "extracted_answer": "[125, '125']",
    "gold_answer": "Using the Pythagorean Theorem, \\begin{align*}\nd&=\\sqrt{75^2+100^2} \\\\\n&=\\sqrt{25^2(3^2+4^2)} \\\\\n&=25\\sqrt{3^2+4^2} \\\\\n&=25\\sqrt{9+16} \\\\\n&=25\\sqrt{25} \\\\\n&=25 \\cdot 5 \\\\\n&=\\boxed{125} \\text{units}\n\\end{align*}",
    "is_correct": true
